          "short": "$12a^2-60a+76$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f(2a-5)&=3(2a-5)^2+1\\\\f(2a-5)&=3(4a^2-20a+25)+1\\\\f(2a-5)&=12a^2-60a+75+1\\\\f(2a-5)&=12a^2-60a+76\\end{align*}$$",
